<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Four healthcare stocks started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Four healthcare stocks started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney initiated coverage of Medtronic Inc and St. Jude Medical Inc with buy recommendations and Abbott Laboratories Inc and Johnson &amp; Johnson with outperform ratings, according to a Smith Barney source.  </p>
<p>-- On the New York Stock Exchange, Medtronic stock rose 1-1/2 to 57-1/2, Abbott gained 1/8 to 46-3/8 and Johnson &amp; Johnson slipped 1/8 to 48-5/8.</p>
<p>-- In Nasdaq trade, St. Jude added 9/16 to 36-3/16.</p>
</text>
